[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0816","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0816.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21355","title":"Microsoft Bing 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Bing 存在关键功能缺少身份认证漏洞（CWE-306），未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何权限和用户交互即可通过网络向 Bing 服务发送特制请求，利用缺失认证的接口执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Bing 相关服务，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，可导致机密性数据泄露。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21355"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T23:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:10Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中在服务端修复了 Bing 的身份验证缺失漏洞，用户无需手动安装补丁。建议 Bing API 集成方检查 MSRC 公告 (https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21355) 确认服务端已更新，并在网络层面限制对 Bing 内部 API 端点的未授权访问作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21355","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21355.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21355.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21355.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21355.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/c5f459a3052010f07773b3284cd58a275f902c53/doc/2025-02/Microsoft Bing 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2025-21355.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21355.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21355.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/c5f459a3052010f07773b3284cd58a275f902c53/doc/2025-02/【漏洞预警】CVE-2025-21355：Microsoft Bing 漏洞暴露远程代码执行风险.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21355.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21355.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0816.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0405","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0677","title":"GNU GRUB2 UFS 符号链接处理整数溢出致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 UFS 文件系统模块在处理符号链接查找时存在整数溢出漏洞。当解析符号链接时，该模块根据 inode 数据大小分配内部缓冲区，但未检查符号链接数据大小是否发生整数溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配的内存小于实际所需。后续从磁盘读取数据到缓冲区时，grub_ufs_lookup_symlink() 函数会越界写入堆内存，破坏堆中存储的数据。本地攻击者可通过挂载特制的恶意文件系统触发此漏洞，实现任意代码执行，从而绕过安全启动（Secure Boot）机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的系统，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0677"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T19:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"升级 grub2 至修复版本：RHEL 9 升级至 grub2-2.06-104.el9_6 及以上，RHEL 10 升级至 grub2-2.12-15.el10_0 及以上，其他发行版升级至包含 commit c4bc55da 的版本。运行 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg` 重建引导配置并重启系统。如无法立即升级，启用 Secure Boot 的 lockdown 模式可阻止加载存在漏洞的文件系统模块作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:16154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0677","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346116","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0677.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0677.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/9fcbc97b46844d320d26a2d5f21aad2642977429/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0677","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0677.patch","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0677.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0677.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-0677.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0402","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0624","title":"GNU GRUB2 网络配置搜索功能越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 网络引导过程中，grub_net_search_config_file() 函数在搜索配置文件时，使用 grub_strcpy() 将用户可控的环境变量复制到内部缓冲区，但未在分配缓冲区时校验环境变量长度，导致越界写入漏洞。同一网段内的攻击者可通过构造特制的网络引导请求触发该漏洞，实现远程代码执行，进而绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 GRUB2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0624"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T19:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:30Z","remediation":"立即更新 GRUB2 至包含 2025-02-18 安全补丁的版本。上游补丁已由 Daniel Kiper 发布在 grub-devel 邮件列表（msg00027/msg00052），核心修复为将 `grub_net_search_config_file()` 中的 `grub_strcpy()` 替换为 `grub_strlcpy()` 并传入缓冲区长度参数。各发行版用户请关注对应安全公告：RHEL 用户安装 ALAS2023-2025-937 更新；Ubuntu 用户安装 USN 对应更新；Debian 用户等待 grub2 包更新。如无法立即更新，可在 GRUB 配置中设置 `disable_net_search=1` 禁用网络启动配置搜索作为临时缓解措施，或限制 PXE 启动环境仅允许受信任的 DHCP/TFTP 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2521","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2653","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2655","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2675","https://access.redhat.com/errata/R