25/02/GHSA-f2jv-hxph-r5wm/GHSA-f2jv-hxph-r5wm.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-0999.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0421.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0421.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0403","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0633","title":"iniparser iniparser_dumpsection_ini 函数堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"iniparser 库中的 iniparser_dumpsection_ini() 函数存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122）。攻击者可通过向该函数传入特制的 INI 配置文件，触发堆内存越界读取，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞需要本地访问权限才能利用，攻击复杂度较低，无需用户交互即可触发。影响范围包括使用 iniparser 库解析 INI 配置文件的各类应用，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0633"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T07:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:52Z","remediation":"建议立即将 iniparser 升级到 v4.2.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 iniparser_dumpsection_ini() 中的堆缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 iniparser_dumpsection_ini() 前对输入数据进行长度校验，避免传入超长 section 名称或畸形 INI 内容触发越界读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.com/iniparser/iniparser/-/issues/177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/aced02b678cc4062da6e11482c0850c64f73ef89/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-06xx/CVE-2025-0633.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0633"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0937","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0937.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21703","title":"Linux 内核 netem 网络模拟器释放后使用漏洞","description":"` tags, which is causing the \"description field is empty\" error\n5. I need to output ONLY the field value inside `<value>` tags\n\nLet me analyze the NVD data:\n- Linux kernel netem module vulnerability\n- Use-after-free (UAF) vulnerability\n- Root cause: before calling `qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog()`, the code didn't reduce the child qdisc's backlog count\n- This causes the function to miss the opportunity to call `cops->qlen_notify()`\n- In DRR (Deficit Round Robin) queue discipline, this callback maintains the active list\n- Missing the call results in UAF\n- CVSS: 7.8, AV:L/AC:L/PR:L - local attacker, low privileges needed\n- CWE-416 (Use After Free)\n\nFrom local data:\n- SEC-bench verified KASAN_UAF: `BUG: KASAN: slab-use-after-free in drr_dequeue`\n- Affects Linux kernel with DRR qdisc configuration\n- Red Hat: moderate severity\n- Multiple kernel versions affected (from remediation field: 5.4, 5.10, 5.15, 6.1, 6.6, 6.12 before fix)\n\nThe fix commits are for stable kernels: 5.4.291, 5.10.235, 5.15.179, 6.1.129, 6.6.78, 6.12.14\n\nI need to write a clean Chinese description without the malformed `<value>` tags. Let me craft it carefully.\n\nKey points to include:\n- 漏洞原理: 释放后使用(UAF)，netem模块中`qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog()`调用前未减少子qdisc的backlog计数，导致DRR队列调度器错过`cops->qlen_notify()`回调，维护活跃队列列表时发生释放后使用\n- 影响范围: Linux内核中使用DRR（Deficit Round Robin）队列调度规则的版本\n- 攻击条件: 本地低权限攻击者，无需用户交互\n- 后果: 拒绝服务或权限提升\n- CVSS 7.8\n\nLet me write a comprehensive description:\n\nLinux内核netem（网络仿真）模块中存在释放后使用漏洞。其根本原因在于，在调用`qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog()`函数通知父队列调度器之前，代码未先减少子队列调度器的backlog计数，导致该函数无法检测到子队列已清空的状态，从而错过了调用`cops->qlen_notify()`回调的机会。在使用DRR（Deficit Round Robin）队列调度算法的系统中，该回调用于维护活跃队列列表，错过调用将导致释放后使用。具有本地访问权限的低权限攻击者可通过特定操作触发此漏洞，无需用户交互，成功利用后可导致系统拒绝服务或获取高权限执行权限。\n\nLet me count characters... That's well over 50 characters.\n\nWait, looking at the current TOML, the description field has:\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\n标签之间。Linux内核netem...\n...\n\"\"\"\n```\n\nThis is malformed TOML - triple quotes with `<value>` tags inside the triple quotes. That's why the parser sees it as empty or invalid. The fix is to replace the entire description value with a clean string.\n\nI should output just the clean description text inside `<value>` tags.<value>Linux内核netem（网络仿真）模块中存在释放后使用漏洞。其根本原因在于，在调用`qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog()`函数通知父队列调度器之前，代码未先减少子队列调度器的backlog计数，导致该函数无法检测到子队列已清空的状态，从而错过了调用`cops->qlen_notify()`回调的机会。在使用DRR（Deficit Round Robin）队列调度算法的系统中，该回调用于维护活跃队列列表，错过调用将触发释放后使用，KASAN检测到`drr_dequeue`函数中存在slab-use-after-free错误。该漏洞影响配置DRR队列调度规则的Linux内核版本，CVSS评分为7.8。具有本地访问权限的低权限攻击者可通过特定操作触发此漏洞，无需用户交互，成功利用后可导致系统拒绝服务或获取高权限执行权限。\n","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21703"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T15:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:04Z","remediation":"标签之间。<value>升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.78 或 6.12.14 及以上。Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 安装对应版本：20.04 LTS 升级至 5.4.0-214.234、22.04 LTS 升级至 5.15.0-138.148、24.10 升级至 6.11.0-24.24。如暂无法升级，可临时禁用 netem 流量控制模块（rmmod sch_netem 或删除相关 tc 规则），并限制本地低权限用户访问网络命名空间中的 DRR qdisc 配置，以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f8e3f4a4b8b90ad274dfbc66fc7d55cb582f4d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6312555249082d6d8cc5321ff725df05482d8b83","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/638ba5089324796c2ee49af10427459c2de35f71","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7b79ca9a1de6a428d486ff52fb3d602321c08f55","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7f31d74fcc556a9166b1bb20515542de7bb939d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/839ecc583fa00fab785fde1c85a326743657fd32","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/98a2c685293aae122f688cde11d9334dddc5d207","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e395fec75ac2dbffc99b4bce57b7f1f3c5449f2c","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21703.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21703.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21703.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21703.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21703.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21703.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/c93d2643e035f504bcc39587d19bad3c64044b2f/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21703.md","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/a6cedddd3ffee87d1e47b8f03744aab4872efe0e/projects/linux/CVE-2025-21703/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21703.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0937.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0583","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0583.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1390","title":"libcap pam_cap 模块配置解析错误本地权限提升漏洞","description":"libcap 的 PAM 模块 pam_cap.so 在解析 /etc/security/capability.conf 配置文件时存在缺陷：规范支持以 \"@\" 开头的组名，但实际解析过程中，凡是不以 \"@\" 开头的配置项也会被错误地识别为组名。这导致非预期的用户被误授予继承的权限能力集，可能引发本地权限提升。攻击者可通过构造特定的用户名，结合使用该配置文件进行权限分配的系统环境，触发此解析错误，从而获得本不应拥有的 capabilities。该漏洞影响使用 libcap 并依赖 capability.conf 配置用户继承权限的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分为 6.1（中等），攻击需具备本地访问权限且用户已存在于配置中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1390"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T03:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:02Z","remediation":"升级 libcap 库至修复版本：Ubuntu 系统请安装 libpam-cap 1:2.66-5ubuntu2.2（22.04 LTS）/ 1:2.66-5ubuntu2.2（24.04 LTS）/ 1:2.66-5ubuntu3.1（24.10），Debian 系统请升级至 libcap2 1:2.44-1+deb11u1（bullseye）/ 1:2.66-4+deb12u1（bookworm）/ 1:2.75-10+deb13u1（trixie），其他发行版请更新至包含 commit 1ad42b66c3567481cc5fa22fc1ba1556a316d878 的 libcap 2.78 或更高版本。更新后需重启系统使 pam_cap.so 新版本生效。如无法立即打补丁，可临时编辑 /etc/security/capability.conf，确保不以用户名为条目配置继承权限，仅使用以 \"@\" 开头的组名格式，以消除被错误解析为非组名条目的风险，并严格限制 /etc/security/capability.conf 文件权限为 600，仅允许 root 用户读取修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.openanolis.cn/show_bug.cgi?id=18804","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-1390.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c61100b82badca16ad107892eaf1ce53a00c3776/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dab254278a60adf6b8fb2b95188a4f609cd2e674/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7ebe16a87d7482b578f5baf29517e74408f62ab5/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7ebe16a87d7482b578f5baf29517e74408f62ab5/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5a7f3ccb6b354d61d4323083fa9c1d84dcae305b/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-13xx/CVE-2025-1390.json","https://github.com/ktauchathuranga/CVE-2025-70994"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0583.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0580","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0580.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1377","title":"GNU elfutils eu-strip 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GNU elfutils 0.192 版本的 eu-strip 组件在 strip.c 文件的 gelf_getsymshndx 函数中存在缺陷。攻击者可通过构造特制的 ELF 文件，在具有本地访问权限的情况下触发该函数处理符号表索引时的异常，导致程序崩溃并引发拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响 GNU elfutils 0.192 及相关发行版，攻击条件为目标系统处理恶意伪造的二进制文件。建议尽快应用官方补丁（patch id: fbf1df9ca286de3323ae541973b08449f8d03aba）以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1377"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-17T05:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:01Z","remediation":"建议将 GNU elfutils 升级至已修复该漏洞的最新版本。对于源码安装的用户，请手动应用补丁 fbf1df9ca286de3323ae541973b08449f8d03aba；对于使用发行版（如 SUSE, Ubuntu）的用户，请通过系统包管理器更新 elfutils 软件包至最新补丁版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15941","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32673","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32673#c2","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295985","https://vuldb.com/?id.295985","https://vuldb.com/?submit.497539","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-13773.yaml"