可从 GNU 官方 Git 仓库手动应用该补丁后重新编译安装。临时缓解措施为避免使用 eu-strip 处理来源不明的 ELF 文件，限制本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15940","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32672","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32672#c3","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295984","https://vuldb.com/?id.295984","https://vuldb.com/?submit.497538","https://www.gnu.org/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-253495.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-1376.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1376.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4737a147a20cab10b00f750066e37f71a687da01/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1376.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-13763.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-13767.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-13765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1376.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1376.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3eeaeb834be138ec333241b53d2f3ecf4145ea0/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1376.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1376.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0578.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0575","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1372","title":"GNU elfutils eu-readelf 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU elfutils 0.192 版本的 eu-readelf 组件在 readelf.c 文件的 dump_data_section 与 print_string_section 函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造一个特制的 ELF 格式文件，并在本地环境下利用 eu-readelf 工具对其进行解析，通过操纵参数 z/x 触发内存溢出。该漏洞的影响范围涵盖所有使用受影响版本 GNU elfutils 的系统，可能导致程序异常崩溃或被利用实现本地代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1372"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-17T03:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:00Z","remediation":"建议将 GNU elfutils 更新至 0.192 之后的修复版本，或手动应用官方发布的补丁（Patch ID: 73db9d2021cab9e23fd734b0a76a612d52a6f1db）。对于 Linux 发行版用户，请及时执行系统更新（如 `yum update` 或 `apt upgrade`）以安装由厂商分发的安全更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15927","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32656","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32656#c3","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32657","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295981","https://vuldb.com/?id.295981","https://vuldb.com/?submit.496485","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/6b93a174634cc0755a555ba6e9fd5dd4026076e8/SPECS/elfutils/CVE-2025-1372.patch","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1372.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1372.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-1372"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0574","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1371","title":"GNU elfutils 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"GNU elfutils 0.192 版本中的 eu-read 组件存在空指针解引用漏洞。该漏洞位于 readelf.c 文件的 handle_dynamic_symtab 函数中，当程序处理特制的 ELF 文件时，由于未能正确校验指针导致空指针解引用，从而引发程序崩溃（拒绝服务）。攻击者需要具备本地访问权限，通过诱导受害者或系统使用 readelf 工具分析恶意构造的二进制文件来触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1371"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-17T03:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:00Z","remediation":"建议将 GNU elfutils 升级至最新版本，或手动应用官方发布的修复补丁 b38e562a4c907e08171c76b8b2def8464d5a104a 以修复 readelf.c 中 handle_dynamic_symtab 函数的空指针解引用漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15926","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32655","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32655#c2","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295978","https://vuldb.com/?id.295978","https://vuldb.com/?submit.496484","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1371.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1371.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-1371","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1371.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0572","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1365","title":"GNU elfutils eu-readelf readelf.c process_symtab 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU elfutils 0.192 版本的 eu-readelf 组件中存在一个缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞位于 `readelf.c` 文件的 `process_symtab` 函数中，当攻击者通过特定参数（如 D/a）操纵输入时，会导致内存缓冲区溢出。由于该漏洞需要本地访问权限，攻击者需在目标系统上拥有执行权限或诱导用户处理恶意 ELF 文件。成功利用此漏洞可能导致程序崩溃或在特定条件下实现本地代码执行。目前该漏洞已公开，建议用户及时更新补丁以修复此安全问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1365"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-17T00:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:59Z","remediation":"建议立即应用官方发布的补丁（Patch ID: 5e5c0394d82c53e97750fe7b18023e6f84157b81）以修复 readelf.c 中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。对于使用发行版的用户，请通过包管理器（如 apt, yum, dnf）将 GNU elfutils 升级至最新安全版本。在无法立即更新的环境中，建议限制对受影响二进制文件的本地执行权限，以降低攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15925","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32654","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32654#c2","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295977","https://vuldb.com/?id.295977","https://vuldb.com/?submit.496483","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-13652.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0da25b98d7bcc33832f1568bdeed8ba3a55a37d8/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4b1ea840e69d6d4f3d79389a15a3128b50079713/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-13654.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1365.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1365.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-1365"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0572.toml"}]